  "id": "COMPOUND:42953 - PROTEIN:4923",
  "verbalization": "Certonardosterol D3 appears to have a shared target of SNU-387, which is involved in targeting Neuropilin-2 through multiple pathways. The evidence suggests that Certonardosterol D3 may act as a modulator of SNU-387, which in turn influences Neuropilin-2 via different biochemical mechanisms. These mechanisms include the direct targeting of SNU-387 by Certonardosterol D3, followed by the involvement of SNU-387 in the targeting of other compounds like (3R)-5,8,9-trimethoxy-2,2-dimethyl-3,4-dihydropyrano[2,3-b]quinolin-3-ol and Ethyl 2-acetamido-2-(dimethylamino)acetate, all of which ultimately target Neuropilin-2. The integration of these pathways highlights a potential role for Certonardosterol D3 in regulating the activity of SNU-387, which may have a broader impact on Neuropilin-2 through a network of downstream targets. The evidence supports a mechanism where Certonardosterol D3 could influence Neuropilin-2 via SNU-387, though the exact nature of this interaction remains to be fully elucidated.",
